: null, "extra": {}, "language": null, "summary": "Viking AI Search and SearchCLI enable developers to build personal information radars in 30 minutes. SearchCLI automates data crawling, cleaning, and incremental syncing, while Viking AI Search provides integrated search, recommendation, and Q&A capabilities. A developer named Xiao V eliminated manual browsing of multiple sources by configuring automated crawlers for WeChat articles, product reports, and arXiv papers. The system requires minimal setup: install SearchCLI, provide authentication credentials, and describe desired content and update frequency to an agent. Data flows automatically into Viking AI Search for indexing, enabling semantic search, personalized recommendations, and multi-turn question answering with cited sources."}, "settings": {}}